OL,3,GNEWSAActor's reading of soldier's final
OL,4,Aletter helps mother grieve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA soldier's last letter home - read out
OL,7,Fby actor Daniel Mays at the Royal
OL,8,FBritish Legion Festival of Remembrance
OL,9,F- has helped his mother face her grief.
OL,11,FThe annual televised event at the Royal
OL,12,FAlbert Hall honours the service and
OL,13,Fsacrifice of members of the armed
OL,14,Fforces and includes personal
OL,15,Ftestimonies from serving personnel,
OL,16,Fveterans and their families.
OL,18,FGunner Lee Darren Thornton, 22, of
OL,19,FBlackpool, served in the Iraq War and
OL,20,Fdied in 2006.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
