OL,3,GNEWSAActor's reading of soldier's final
OL,4,Aletter helps mother grieve
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the remembrance event, Line of
OL,7,FDuty actor Mays read out an emotional
OL,8,Fletter Lee had written to his fiancee,
OL,9,Fwhich Lee's mother, Karen Thornton,
OL,10,Fsaid had felt "as if Lee himself was
OL,11,Freading it". Mays called it "one of the
OL,12,Fgreatest honours of my life".
